     "headline": "REM enforces television restrictions amid Informer protest",
     "paragraphs": [
      "A seven-day ban on Informer’s “Prve info” programme and equivalent programming has taken effect, while REM temporarily restricted two TV Kurir news programmes, imposed a one-day advertising ban on TV Prva and closed proceedings against TV K1 without a penalty. Informer supporters rallied outside REM. Editor Dragan J. Vučićević alleged a politically directed campaign and said Informer had filed criminal complaints against council members; Professor Ana Marinoli said the regulator was enforcing rules rather than retaliating. Prva said it had removed the offending programme before proceedings began."
     ],
     "why": "The decisions put broadcasting oversight and the regulator’s independence at the centre of the political transition.",
