     "headline": "Central bank gives stability assurances as Student List plans Idea measures",
     "paragraphs": [
      "The National Bank of Serbia says the dinar is stable, foreign-exchange reserves are sufficient, dinar payment systems are operating normally and Banka Poštanska štedionica operated normally over the weekend. The assurances follow the revocation of ALTA banka’s licence on 31 October and owner Davor Macura’s detention on 2 November. The Student List says the new government will urgently present measures to stabilise Idea Marketi and protect employees, suppliers and consumers. It also wants scrutiny of Macura’s acquisition of the retailer and its financing; Macura is detained on suspicion of taking funds from ALTA banka."
     ],
     "why": "The bank’s closure has prompted both financial-stability assurances and plans to protect a major retailer’s supply chain.",
