      "According to an independent-media report, a Supreme Public Prosecutor’s Office commission published an oversight report accusing Belgrade chief prosecutor Nenad Stefanović of establishing a parallel prosecutorial system and proposing criminal prosecution. The commission criticised his office’s handling of the alleged use of a sound cannon at a 2025 protest, including its investigation of people who reported it."
