     "headline": "SPS officials demand leadership resignations after election defeat",
     "paragraphs": [
      "Caretaker minister Novica Tončev and SPS committee representatives called for the party leadership to resign after SPS failed to cross the parliamentary threshold. Presidency member Toma Fila said Belgrade representatives briefly walked out of a leadership meeting before Ivica Dačić brought them back. Dačić defended contesting the election separately from SNS, saying a joint list would have absorbed SPS. The party plans to discuss a possible presidential candidate next week and elect new leadership at a February congress."
     ],
